          "message": {
            "text": "Package: libpng\nInstalled Version: 1.6.47-r0\nVulnerability CVE-2025-64720\nSeverity: HIGH\nFixed Version: 1.6.53-r0\nLink: [CVE-2025-64720](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-64720)"
